/* Tfa117: OPEN_SHELL: two planar ADVANCED_FACE entities; face[0] at z=0 has degenerate zero-length edge at vertex (1,0,0) breaking the bottom edge of the 2×1 rectangle; face[1] at z=1 is a normal 2×1 rectangle with vertex at (1,0,1); ShapeAnalysis_CheckSmallFace::CheckSplittingVertices cannot classify the T-vertex at (1,0,0) because the zero-length edge has no meaningful parameter domain for midpoint detection; defect IS on live OPEN_SHELL traversal path */
